# Integrals with singular / oscillatory endpoints (CAS-testing classics).
integrate sin(x)/x from 0 to inf
integrate sin(x^2) from 0 to inf
integrate cos(x^2) from 0 to inf
integrate 1/sqrt(x) from 0 to 1
integrate log(x) from 0 to 1
integrate x^x from 0 to 1
integrate log(sin(x)) from 0 to pi/2
integrate log(x)/(1+x^2) from 0 to inf
integrate 1/(1+x^2) from 0 to inf
integrate 1/(1+x^2)^2 from 0 to inf
integrate 1/cosh(x) from -inf to inf
integrate 1/(x*log(x)^2) from 2 to inf
integrate sin(x)^2/x^2 from 0 to inf
integrate 1/(x-1)^2 from 0 to 2
